      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Requirement:\n\n\nUsers can create/update individual expenses.\nSplit by different algorithms like equal, unequal, percentage wise, etc.\nUsers can check the history of expenses.\nUsers can track payments.\n\nBonus requirements:\nUsers can create/update group expenses.\nSimplify debts → If A is owing 50 bucks to B and B is owing 50 bucks to C, then A should owe 50 bucks to C.(Reduce the transactions)\nBalance sheet of each user → how much money I’m owing to user A\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 318,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Requirement:\n\n\nUsers can create/update individual expenses.\nSplit by different algorithms like equal, unequal, percentage wise, etc.\nUsers can check the history of expenses.\nUsers can track payments.\n\nBonus requirements:\nUsers can create/update group expenses.\nSimplify debts → If A is owing 50 bucks to B and B is owing 50 bucks to C, then A should owe 50 bucks to C.(Reduce the transactions)\nBalance sheet of each user → how much money I’m owing to user A\n",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
